  m_Name: Crossroads
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Stage::Game.Stage.Config.LevelAsset
  _title: The Crossroads
  _scene: Crossroads
  _briefing: 'Two warbands march from the west and the north and meet at the old
    crossroads before the city gate. Guard the place where the roads join: one well-built
    knot of towers can hold them both, but do not leave either road bare.'
  _victory: Both warbands broke at the crossroads. Scouts report something far larger
    stirring in the frozen mountains.
  _gold: 300
  _lives: 20
  _rest: 12
